[
    {
        "content": "<p>The update to <code>v4.35.0-rc2</code> has caused a 6x duration regression in the 'test Mathlib' (i.e. <code>lake test</code> on Mathlib) step:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2054x1168\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/39_g1jt-XmOgxhw4OFmQUZ7P/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/39_g1jt-XmOgxhw4OFmQUZ7P/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p>The culprit seems to be <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/15159\">lean4#15159</a>, in particular affecting <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/master/MathlibTest/LibrarySuggestions/sineQuaNon.lean\">sineQuaNon.lean</a></p>\n<p>Here's a non-mathlib mwe:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">Lean-only version of Mathlib's `MathlibTest/LibrarySuggestions/sineQuaNon.lean`,</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">timing each `grind +suggestions` call separately.</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">set_library_suggestions</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">LibrarySuggestions</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sineQuaNonSelector</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"timed \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">monoNanosNow</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">evalTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">monoNanosNow</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{(t1 - t0).toFloat / 1e9} s\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Dyadic</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">prec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">roundDown</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">fail_if_success</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">timed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"n\">suggestions</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Dyadic</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">prec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">roundDown</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≤</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">timed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"n\">suggestions</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Giving:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>$<span class=\"w\"> </span>lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>+leanprover/lean4:v4.35.0-rc1<span class=\"w\"> </span>SineQuaNonGrind.lean\n<span class=\"m\">0</span>.349789<span class=\"w\"> </span>s\n<span class=\"m\">0</span>.142014<span class=\"w\"> </span>s\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>$<span class=\"w\"> </span>lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>+leanprover/lean4:v4.35.0-rc2<span class=\"w\"> </span>SineQuaNonGrind.lean\n<span class=\"m\">38</span>.594516<span class=\"w\"> </span>s\n<span class=\"m\">0</span>.163176<span class=\"w\"> </span>s\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Here's some explicit benchmarking:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">Time the first (cold) and second (warm) library-suggestion queries in one process.</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">Compare `v4.35.0-rc1` (indexes precomputed in oleans) with `v4.35.0-rc2` (indexes built on</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">first use, lean4#15159).</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LibrarySuggestions</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SineQuaNon</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">timeIt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">summary</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">monoNanosNow</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">monoNanosNow</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">println</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{label}: {(t1 - t0).toFloat / 1e9} s ({summary a})\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">run_meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">println</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"imported constants: {(← getEnv).constants.map₁.size}\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">discard</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">timeIt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"symbolFrequencyMap (cold)\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbolFrequencyMap</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{m.size} symbols, Nat ↦ {m.getD `Nat 0}\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">discard</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">timeIt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"symbolFrequencyMap (warm)\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbolFrequencyMap</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{m.size} symbols\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">discard</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">timeIt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"sineQuaNonTheorems (cold)\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sineQuaNonTheorems</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`HAppend.hAppend</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{l.length} theorems\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">discard</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">timeIt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"sineQuaNonTheorems (warm)\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sineQuaNonTheorems</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`HAppend.hAppend</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{l.length} theorems\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">┌──────────────────────────┬────────────┬────────────┬──────────┐</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Cold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">call</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rc1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">median</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rc2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">median</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Slowdown</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">├──────────────────────────┼────────────┼────────────┼──────────┤</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">symbolFrequencyMap</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">5.5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ms</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">6.39</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">~</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">165</span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">├──────────────────────────┼────────────┼────────────┼──────────┤</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sineQuaNonTheorems</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">30.5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ms</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">6.30</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">~</span><span class=\"mi\">206</span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">├──────────────────────────┼────────────┼────────────┼──────────┤</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Whole</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">process</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wall</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.82</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">13.55</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">~</span><span class=\"mi\">17</span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\">     </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">└──────────────────────────┴────────────┴────────────┴──────────┘</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>cc <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110087\">@Kim Morrison</span></p>",
        "id": 627503240,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1790615922
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I made the robots open an issue at <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/15392\">lean4#15392</a>, plus an attempt at improving the situation at <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/15391\">lean4#15391</a>. Looks like the feature itself always means some perf hit at first use (the original PR states this as well), but it improves considerably:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1574x1000\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/zHz9FVlRU1VCblM0-GbX_BeV/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/zHz9FVlRU1VCblM0-GbX_BeV/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
        "id": 627571608,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1790633937
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The alternative is to just revert the original commit, for which: <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/15402\">lean4#15402</a> [edit: looks like this needs a stage0 update...]</p>\n<p>Are there measurements motivating the original change? Are we missing some benchmark like <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/15390\">lean4#15390</a> to better inform changes in this logic?</p>",
        "id": 627768837,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1790685689
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>In the meantime I opened <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/44318\">#44318</a> to temporarily disable these tests in mathlib</p>",
        "id": 627769033,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1790685725
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Perhaps the body of <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/15159\">lean#15159</a> could have been clearer: this is a soft deprecation of, to our knowledge, an unused feature. Removing the tests should be the correct solution.</p>",
        "id": 627775483,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Ullrich",
        "timestamp": 1790686747
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Oh. Well, mathlib's <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/master/Mathlib/Init.lean\">Init.lean</a> mentions it explicitly </p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1424x128\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/ppqhmkl3OQNpFmca9UjthGmR/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/ppqhmkl3OQNpFmca9UjthGmR/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p>and <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/master/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Default.lean\">Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Default</a> sets it as the default.</p>",
        "id": 627779487,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1790687470
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>By \"unused feature\", do you mean <code>+suggestions</code> itself or just the Sine Qua Non engine?</p>",
        "id": 627779968,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1790687568
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>As far as I know, both</p>",
        "id": 627780968,
        "sender_full_name": "Sebastian Ullrich",
        "timestamp": 1790687754
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Sorry, this was over-eager. The fact that <code>try?</code> is still calling into this means we need a better solution.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/15391\">#15391</a> looks pretty good to me; I pushed an additional commit so it respects the requested (<code>-j</code>) thread count. <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"439514\">@Marcelo Lynch</span>, if you're happy with that could you take the PR out of draft?</p>",
        "id": 628665619,
        "sender_full_name": "Kim Morrison",
        "timestamp": 1790946816
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>By the way I opened <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/44323\">#44323</a> after discussing with <span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"479299\">Jovan Gerbscheid</span> . In any case I published <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/15391\">lean4#15391</a></p>",
        "id": 628667905,
        "sender_full_name": "Marcelo Lynch",
        "timestamp": 1790947304
    }
]